================================================================================
Third-party typefaces
================================================================================

This product bundles the **Thmanyah typeface family** (Sans, Serif Display,
Serif Text — 5 weights each) in `core/design-system/src/main/res/font/`. The
typefaces are © Thmanyah (https://thmanyah.com). They are used here under the
license terms published by Thmanyah; consult that license before redistributing
the OTF files outside this Android application package.

If Thmanyah's license does not permit your intended use, replace the OTFs in
`core:design-system/src/main/res/font/` with any other compatible Arabic + Latin
font family and update `core:design-system/.../theme/Typography.kt` accordingly.

